## Global contact plan for adjacent contacts test
## This configuration demonstrates adjacent contacts: two contacts with exact boundary match

m horizon +0

## Add range (OWLT = 1 second between nodes 1 and 2)
a range +0 +2000 1 2 1
a range +0 +2000 2 1 1

## ADJACENT CONTACTS for Node 1->2
## First contact: from +10 to +60 seconds (50 sec duration)
a contact +10 +60 1 2 1000000
a contact +10 +60 2 1 1000000

## Second contact (ADJACENT): from +60 to +110 seconds (50 sec duration)
## This contact starts exactly when the first one ends (boundary time = 60)
a contact +60 +2000 1 2 2000000
a contact +60 +2000 2 1 2000000
